Init_Front_End / FUN_0044caa8: contiguous light-direction vector for FUN_00420708

Scattered-locals class. asm 0x44b2c1/0x44b2e3: `lea edi,[ebp-0x34]` + movs x4 copies
the 16-byte constant block @0x44b2a8 = {40,650,650,0} into ONE contiguous stack slot,
and the call 0x44b5e4-0x44b5ec passes that slot as FUN_00420708's direction vector
(the reference receives vec=[40,650,650] at 0x420708 entry, captured via hbreak).
Ghidra split the block into `int local_38; undefined4 uStack_34/uStack_30/uStack_2c`,
which gcc reorders/scatters -> &local_38 no longer addresses a {40,650,650} triple ->
FUN_00420708 computes uVar2=uVar3=0 from garbage and SIGFPEs on `/ local_14`
(division by zero) as soon as the harness actually boots the front end
(Init_Front_End is now part of the DD2_LEVEL launch path: LEV0 textures fill
texturespace pages 20-25 that race levels never overwrite -- the black
sky-panorama wedges). FUN_0044caa8 @0x44caa8 repeats the same pattern with the
constant block @0x44ca98.

